WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.045
Tor rubbed her wing.

2
00:00:06.046 --> 00:00:10.097
"Tor, are you okay?" Sid asked.

3
00:00:10.098 --> 00:00:14.640
"Yes," Tor said.

4
00:00:14.641 --> 00:00:21.217
"I just need to rest my wing."

5
00:00:21.218 --> 00:00:25.818
"We can wait," Sara said.

6
00:00:25.819 --> 00:00:32.695
The buddies waited.

7
00:00:32.696 --> 00:00:35.932
But the sun was very hot.

8
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:40.394
And there was nothing to do.

9
00:00:40.395 --> 00:00:48.830
Sara looked at her hat.

10
00:00:48.831 --> 00:00:55.565
"How can we get that hat?" Rex said.

11
00:00:55.566 --> 00:01:03.426
"Let's jump," Sid said.

12
00:01:03.427 --> 00:01:08.220
Rex, Sid, and Sara jumped.

13
00:01:08.221 --> 00:01:15.552
Nobody could reach the hat.

14
00:01:15.553 --> 00:01:18.633
Rex tried to climb the tree.

15
00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:22.341
He slid down. "Oof!"

16
00:01:22.342 --> 00:01:32.364
Tor sighed. "I wish I could help."

17
00:01:32.365 --> 00:01:38.561
"I know!" Rex said.

18
00:01:38.562 --> 00:01:41.235
Rex threw a rock.

19
00:01:41.236 --> 00:01:52.310
The rock flew high . . . too high!

20
00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:55.789
Rex tried again and again.

21
00:01:55.790 --> 00:02:01.969
But he couldn't hit the hat.

22
00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:09.077
Sara sighed. "Thank you, Rex.

23
00:02:09.078 --> 00:02:16.987
But my hat is stuck forever!"

